<p>The light of your Radiance allows you to see that which would normally be unseen and strike that which would normally be protected.</p><p>All enemies in your Radiance aura have their invisibility and stealth power reduced by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">74;, 95;, 110;, 124;, 136;</acronym> all actors affected by illumination have their defense reduced by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">24, 31, 36, 41, 45</acronym> as well as all evasion bonuses from being unseen negated.</p><p>In addition, your light damage is increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2%, 5%, 6%, 8%, 10%</acronym> and your strikes ignore <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 27%, 36%, 42%, 46%</acronym> of the light resistance of your targets.</p><p>The invisibility, stealth power, and defense reductions increase with your Spellpower.</p>